        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stalker-themed, “Exit 8–style” psychological horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is to track down the intruder—a twisted creep who has broken into your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※1 – About Pattern Progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To view all possible patterns, please continue playing without closing the game, even after a Game Over or a successful clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you close the game, all patterns will reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※2 – Choice Selection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On choice-selection screens, use the Up/Down keys or Right Click to navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To sleep or to call the police, right-click on your bed and a selection menu will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys / WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse drag (up / down / left / right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursor Control During Pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse drag</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Creation / Streaming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and video uploads are allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the game title and a link to the store page.</p>",
